   "summary": "The law changed section 105 of title 17 by replacing “Certain of Works” with “Certain Works” in the heading, and by replacing “The Secretary of Defense” with “A covered Secretary” in subsection (c). It also rewrote subsection (c) to separate Secretary of Defense authority from Director of National Intelligence authority, and renumbered the second subsection (c) as subsection (d) [2022-117-263-105-1] [2022-117-263-105-2] [2022-117-263-105-7] [2022-117-263-105-3]. The law added a definition of “covered Secretary” in section 105(d), added the United States Merchant Marine Academy and National Intelligence University to section 105(d)(2), and renumbered paragraph (3) as paragraph (4) [2022-117-263-105-6] [2022-117-263-105-4] [2022-117-263-105-8] [2022-117-263-105-5].",
